{"id":"letztens","lemma":"letztens","pos":"adv","rank":4407,"glosses":["recently; the other day","lastly; finally"],"ipa":"/ˈlɛts.təns/","audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/5/54/De-letztens.ogg/De-letztens.ogg.mp3","examples":[{"text":"Was ist letztens nachts passiert?","en":"What happened the other night?","words":[{"g":"what"},{"g":"is","l":"sein"},null,{"g":"at night, nights"},{"g":"to happen","l":"passieren"}]},{"text":"Ich habe letztens deinen Bruder gesehen.","en":"I saw your brother the other day.","words":[{"g":"I"},{"g":"have","l":"haben"},null,{"g":"thy, your .","l":"dein"},{"g":"brother"},{"g":"to see","l":"sehen"}]},{"text":"Ich habe letztens an dich gedacht.","en":"I thought about you the other day.","words":[{"g":"I"},{"g":"have","l":"haben"},null,{"g":"at / on"},{"g":"you","l":"du"},{"g":"to think","l":"denken"}]},{"text":"Das letztens tut mir leid!","en":"I'm sorry about the other day.","words":[{"g":"the / that"},null,{"g":"to do","l":"tun"},{"g":"(to) me","l":"ich"},{"g":"sorry"}]},{"text":"Sie sind letztens erst eingezogen.","en":"They moved in just the other day.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/592972","words":[{"g":"she / they / you"},{"g":"are","l":"sein"},null,{"g":"first, at first"},{"g":"to thread","l":"einziehen"}]}]}